{"code": 1, "data": {"content": "<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">周末睡懒觉</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">却被小哥的连环call唤醒？</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">买了生鲜</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">却在上班时间送到了？</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">为了保证安全</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">快递放到快递柜，还得专门取一趟？</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">还在为这些小事头疼吗？</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">小哥今天帮你扫清障碍</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">解锁快递新技能！</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">在公众号设置收件偏好，</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">以上问题统统分分钟解决！</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">不知道怎么设置？</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">小哥手把手来教你！</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #c91623; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 20px;\">步骤一</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">扫码进入【京东快递】公众号后</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">点击菜单栏的【个人服务】-进入【个人中心】</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/140026/20/33776/35923/64004b5eF3717059d/1525e6b7b6f9d621.png\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAwMjM4NDk2NQ==&amp;mid=2455777123&amp;idx=2&amp;sn=7aa8f18b570023c8b3262990f9212edc&amp;chksm=8d5fba49ba28335f1cb06678d2e48bcfa27b900603e6b49ca55f354017e6ce57ae05211a085c&amp;token=1575996416&amp;lang=zh_CN#rd\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/126975/39/29458/42917/640043b8F73a8e352/84c5c6f04fc1ac3f.png\" /></span></a></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br /><span style=\"color: #c91623; font-size: 20px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">步骤二</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">点击【收件偏好】</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">选择【添加】</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">进入收件偏好设置页面</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; tex